<title>UK: London silver fixes firmer, market quiet.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes firmer, market quiet.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 431.75 cents up four cents from Tuesday. Barely moved from unchanged opening during quiet morning. Could re-try 440-cent target if gold firms.</p>
<p>GOLD - Firmer on continued short covering, physical buying. Needs to breach $322.50 for further progress.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Quiet, holding gains at $406.00/$410.00, up $3.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up $4.50 at $176.00/$179.00.</p>
</text>
